' === Phase 1: User Input Processing ===
partition "📥 **Phase 1: Multi-Modal Input Processing**" #LightBlue {
  :👤 **User Input**
"Add milk to shopping cart"
+ Current screenshot (1920x1080);
  
  split
    :🗣️ **Natural Language Processing**
• Intent extraction: "add", "milk", "cart"
• Ambiguity detection: multiple milk types?
• Context requirements: current page analysis;
  split again
    :📸 **Visual Context Capture**
• Screenshot analysis
• Page state detection
• Element visibility mapping
• Current navigation context;
  end split
  
  :🔍 **Initial Context Assembly**;
note right
• User intent: add_product_to_cart
• Target product: "milk"
• Current page: product_listing_page
• Available actions: [search, filter, select];
end note
