' === Phase 2: Business Knowledge Retrieval ===
partition "🧠 **Phase 2: Business Knowledge Contextualization**" #LightGreen {
  :📊 **Knowledge Query Execution**
Query BPG for relevant business context;
  
  split
    :🏢 **Entity Knowledge Retrieval**
```cypher
MATCH (e:Entity {name: "Product"})
-[:MANIFESTS_AS]->(ui:UIElement)
-[:IN_CONTEXT]->(p:Page {type: "listing"})
RETURN e.attributes, ui.interaction_patterns
```

**Retrieved:**
• Product entity definition
• Shopping cart entity
• Add-to-cart interaction pattern;
  split again
    :⚙️ **Process Template Lookup**
```cypher
MATCH (pt:ProcessTemplate {name: "add_to_cart"})
-[:REQUIRES]->(entities)
-[:HAS_STEPS]->(steps)
RETURN pt.workflow_sequence, pt.constraints
```

**Retrieved:**
• E-commerce purchase workflow
• Product selection constraints
• Cart interaction requirements;
  split again
    :📋 **Business Rules Query**
```cypher
MATCH (br:BusinessRule)
WHERE br.applies_to CONTAINS "add_to_cart"
RETURN br.constraint, br.validation_logic
```

**Retrieved:**
• Inventory availability check
• User authentication requirements
• Product variant selection rules;
  end split
  
  :🎯 **Knowledge Context Assembly**;
note right
```json
{
  "relevant_entities": ["Product", "ShoppingCart", "User"],
  "applicable_processes": ["product_selection", "cart_addition"],
  "business_constraints": ["check_inventory", "require_login"],
  "gui_interaction_patterns": ["search_then_select", "direct_add"]
}
```
end note
}

' === Phase 3: LLM Prompt Engineering ===
partition "🔧 **Phase 3: Context-Enriched Prompt Construction**" #LightYellow {
  :📝 **Dynamic Prompt Assembly**
Combine user intent + visual context + business knowledge;
  
  :🤖 **Enriched LLM Prompt Construction**;
note right
```
SYSTEM PROMPT:
You are a business-aware automation agent for e-commerce systems.

BUSINESS CONTEXT:
- Current page: Product listing with search and filter capabilities
- Available entities: Products (with inventory), Shopping Cart (empty)
- Business process: To add product to cart: 1) Search/locate product, 2) Verify availability, 3) Add to cart
- Constraints: Must check inventory before adding, User already authenticated

VISUAL CONTEXT:
[Screenshot shows product listing page with search bar, filter options, product grid]

USER INTENT:
"Add milk to shopping cart"

TASK:
Analyze the screenshot and generate step-by-step actions to fulfill user intent while following business process constraints.
```
end note
  
  :📊 **Prompt Optimization**;
note right
• Token count optimization (< 4K tokens)
• Context prioritization (most relevant first)
• Business constraint emphasis
• Visual element focus guidance;
end note
}

