' === Data Flow Summary ===
legend bottom
**🔄 Complete Data Flow Summary:**

**Input Layer:**
• User natural language intent + Visual screenshot context
• Multi-modal input processing and initial context assembly

**Knowledge Layer:** 
• BPG business entity definitions + Process templates + Business rules
• Dynamic knowledge retrieval based on current context

**Intelligence Layer:**
• Context-enriched LLM prompts + Multi-agent coordination
• Business-aware reasoning and action planning

**Execution Layer:**
• Business constraint validation + Real-time adaptive execution
• Platform-specific action execution with business context awareness

**Learning Layer:**
• Execution outcome analysis + Knowledge base evolution
• Prompt engineering optimization + Pattern success tracking

**Key Innovation:** BPG provides business intelligence that LLM agents cannot infer from visual/textual information alone,
enabling high-level user intent understanding with domain-specific business logic compliance.
end legend

